---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SectionHeader from "../components/SectionHeader.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Independent Web Almanac and its editorial leadership."
>
  <SectionHeader
    eyebrow="About"
    title="An editorial publication for human-guided creative work."
    description="Independent Web Almanac publishes fiction, essays, reviews, interviews, and resources that examine how people create meaningful work with modern tools."
  />

  <section class="page-copy">
    <p>
      IWA is an independent editorial publication: a place for durable writing,
      selected creative work, useful resources, reading, discovery, and
      editorial judgment.
    </p>
    <p>
      The Independent Web Almanac is founded and edited by Nick Burchett, who
      has spent decades working in technology, publishing online, building
      independent digital communities, and exploring creative workflows. He is
      the author of fiction and non-fiction works and an active practitioner
      of AI-assisted writing.
    </p>
    <p>
      Editorial decisions are ultimately the responsibility of the editor and
      are guided by the mission and standards of the publication: craft,
      clarity, usefulness, reader experience, and the degree to which a work
      reflects intentional human judgment.
    </p>
    <p>
      The publication comes first. Influence, standards, anthologies,
      contributors, and other institutional work can only follow from a record
      of consistent publishing.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
